{"schema_version":1,"batch_id":"screening-0012","screening_model":"gpt-5.6-luna","reasoning":"medium","prompt_version":"gauss-screening-v1","item_count":25,"subject":"math","topic_key":"radicals_algebraic_expressions","total_weight":97,"expected_output":"screening-0012.output.jsonl","items":[{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_0262","source_sha256":"d6f48fb8acecd3f2566399f91cd326ae15121fbaaa4149d54bc1a4649e940959","subject":"math","section_id":"math_algebraic_foundations","source_topic_key":"radicals_algebraic_expressions","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"عبارت $3(x+2)^2 - (1-2x)^2$ با کدام عدد جمع شود تا حاصل مربع یک عبارت جبری شود؟"}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$75$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$73$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$53$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$27$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"عبارت داده‌شده را ساده می‌کنیم:\n$(2x-1)^2 - 3(x+2)^2 = (4x^2 - 4x + 1) - 3(x^2 + 4x + 4)$\n$= x^2 - 16x - 11$\nاگر $k$ پاسخ مسئله باشد، خواهیم داشت:\n$x^2 - 16x - 11 + k = (x-a)^2 = x^2 - 16x + 64$\n$\\Rightarrow k - 11 = 64 \\Rightarrow k = 75$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":[],"media_evidence":[],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":262,"question_pdf":"5.pdf","question_page":6,"solution_page":27,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_0263","source_sha256":"06de269eb951347f90a0b19e25941ac85af5d19315f166de9189ae9ab8a4152b","subject":"math","section_id":"math_algebraic_foundations","source_topic_key":"radicals_algebraic_expressions","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"با فرض $x^2 + \\frac{4}{x^2} = 6$، حاصل $\\frac{x^4+4}{x^2}$ کدام است؟"}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$6$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$4$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$7$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$8$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"دو طرف معادلهٔ $x^2 + \\frac{4}{x^2} = 6$ را به توان ۲ می‌رسانیم:\n$(x^2 + \\frac{4}{x^2})^2 = 36 \\Rightarrow x^4 + \\frac{16}{x^4} + 8 = 36 \\Rightarrow x^4 + \\frac{16}{x^4} = 28$\n$\\Rightarrow \\frac{x^4}{4} + \\frac{4}{x^4} = 7$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":[],"media_evidence":[],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":263,"question_pdf":"5.pdf","question_page":6,"solution_page":27,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_0264","source_sha256":"a579404e41fcc021a5be0267cbfe31b296b1231aad1d3ae84014b3a93ace5c44","subject":"math","section_id":"math_algebraic_foundations","source_topic_key":"radicals_algebraic_expressions","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"اگر $x^2 - 9x + 3 = 0$ باشد، حاصل $x^2 + \\frac{9}{x^2}$ کدام است؟"}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$64$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$75$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$81$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$85$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"دو طرف معادلهٔ $x^2 - 9x + 3 = \\circ$ را بر $x$ تقسیم می‌کنیم:\n$x - 9 + \\frac{3}{x} = \\circ \\Rightarrow x + \\frac{3}{x} = 9 \\Rightarrow (x + \\frac{3}{x})^2 = 81$\n$\\Rightarrow x^2 + \\frac{9}{x^2} + 6 = 81 \\Rightarrow x^2 + \\frac{9}{x^2} = 75$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":[],"media_evidence":[],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":264,"question_pdf":"5.pdf","question_page":6,"solution_page":27,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_0265","source_sha256":"c8ad5faa1f011917f15e84abe442ba6edcdaad51fdc6e648dc1f5001e1e7cc2f","subject":"math","section_id":"math_algebraic_foundations","source_topic_key":"radicals_algebraic_expressions","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"با فرض $a+b=2$ و $a^2+b^2=5$، مقدار $\\frac{1}{a^4} + \\frac{1}{b^4}$ کدام است؟"}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$390$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$392$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$398$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$400$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"در معادلهٔ $a+b = 2$ دو طرف تساوی را به توان ۲ می‌رسانیم:\n$(a+b)^2 = 4 \\Rightarrow \\begin{cases} a^2 + b^2 + 2ab = 4 \\\\ \\text{از طرفی}: a^2 + b^2 = 5 \\end{cases} \\Rightarrow 2ab = -1$\n$\\Rightarrow ab = -\\frac{1}{2}$\nاکنون مقدار $\\frac{1}{a^4} + \\frac{1}{b^4}$ را محاسبه می‌کنیم.\n$\\frac{1}{a^4} + \\frac{1}{b^4} = \\frac{a^4 + b^4}{a^4b^4} = \\frac{(a^2 + b^2)^2 - 2a^2b^2}{a^4b^4}$\n$= \\frac{5^2 - 2(-\\frac{1}{2})^2}{(-\\frac{1}{2})^4} = \\frac{25 - \\frac{1}{2}}{\\frac{1}{16}} = 16 \\times \\frac{49}{2} = 392$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":[],"media_evidence":[],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":265,"question_pdf":"5.pdf","question_page":6,"solution_page":27,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_0266","source_sha256":"a5ffd2a70c36bbf7f235af1878a6c9e06999b39547ecfe5cee4bdb8f1326d7b9","subject":"math","section_id":"math_algebraic_foundations","source_topic_key":"radicals_algebraic_expressions","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"اگر $15ab = 9a^2 + 4b^2$ باشد، حاصل $\\frac{3a-2b}{3a+2b}$ کدام است؟ ($a>b>0$)"}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$9$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{1}{9}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$3$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{1}{3}$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"عبارت $\\frac{3a - 2b}{3a + 2b}$ را $k$ می‌نامیم:\n$k^2 = \\frac{9a^2 + 4b^2 - 12ab}{9a^2 + 4b^2 + 12ab} = \\frac{15ab - 12ab}{15ab + 12ab} = \\frac{3ab}{27ab} = \\frac{1}{9} \\Rightarrow k = \\frac{1}{3}$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":[],"media_evidence":[],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":266,"question_pdf":"5.pdf","question_page":6,"solution_page":27,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_0267","source_sha256":"e1a8c473834d6712ffb0d9afffeb0f6e6ef3d2c87a18c3a6da84b1b55cfa7a53","subject":"math","section_id":"math_algebraic_foundations","source_topic_key":"radicals_algebraic_expressions","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"اگر $a^2+b^2+c^2=17$ و $ab-ac-bc=16$، حاصل $\\frac{c+7}{a+b}$ کدام است؟ ($a+b>c$)"}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$1$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{3}{2}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$2$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{5}{2}$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"اتحاد زیر برقرار است:\n$(a+b-c)^2 = a^2+b^2+c^2 + 2(ab-ac-bc)$\n$\\Rightarrow (a+b-c)^2 = 17 + 2 \\times 16 = 49 \\Rightarrow a+b-c = \\pm 7$\n$\\xrightarrow{a+b>c} a+b-c = 7 \\Rightarrow a+b = c+7 \\Rightarrow \\frac{c+7}{a+b} = 1$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":[],"media_evidence":[],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":267,"question_pdf":"5.pdf","question_page":6,"solution_page":27,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_0268","source_sha256":"695e5b79777d5e0cdcbcaa4435f35b526a7a566cf34f058e79ee839756e899b8","subject":"math","section_id":"math_algebraic_foundations","source_topic_key":"radicals_algebraic_expressions","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"حاصل عبارت $1 + (x+1)(x^2-x+1)(x-1)(x^2+x+1)$ به ازای $x = \\sqrt[3]{2}$ کدام است؟"}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$4$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$8$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$16$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$64$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"عبارت داده‌شده را $A$ می‌نامیم:\n$A = (x^2-1)(x^2+x+1)(x^2-x+1)+1$\n$= (x-1)(x+1)(x^2+x+1)(x^2-x+1)+1$\n$= \\underbrace{(x-1)(x^2+x+1)}_{x^3-1}\\underbrace{(x+1)(x^2-x+1)}_{x^3+1}+1 = (x^3-1)(x^3+1)+1$\n$= (x^6-1)+1 = x^6 \\xrightarrow{x=\\sqrt[3]{2}} A = (\\sqrt[3]{2})^6 = 4$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":[],"media_evidence":[],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":268,"question_pdf":"5.pdf","question_page":6,"solution_page":27,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_0269","source_sha256":"4dbd7d25b9f1948ad4a679f76cd768c6b06e4efa8a9ac6da760779240f851e3d","subject":"math","section_id":"math_algebraic_foundations","source_topic_key":"radicals_algebraic_expressions","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"اگر $x - \\frac{2}{x} = 6$ باشد، حاصل $x^3 - \\frac{8}{x^3}$ کدام است؟"}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$180$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$216$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$230$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$252$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"در معادلهٔ $x - \\frac{2}{x} = 6$ دو طرف تساوی را به توان ۳ می‌رسانیم:\n$(x - \\frac{2}{x})^3 = 6^3 \\Rightarrow x^3 - 6x + \\frac{12}{x} - \\frac{8}{x^3} = 216$\n$\\Rightarrow x^3 - \\frac{8}{x^3} - 6(x - \\frac{2}{x}) = 216 \\Rightarrow x^3 - \\frac{8}{x^3} - 36 = 216$\n$\\Rightarrow x^3 - \\frac{8}{x^3} = 252$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":[],"media_evidence":[],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":269,"question_pdf":"5.pdf","question_page":6,"solution_page":27,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_0270","source_sha256":"f464d6019138bcfb4d30d80fe467a94f04dbeb1907b2cb8935261be0d45a17b6","subject":"math","section_id":"math_algebraic_foundations","source_topic_key":"radicals_algebraic_expressions","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"اگر $a+b=3$ و $a^3+b^3=18$ باشد، حاصل $a^2+b^2$ کدام است؟"}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$5$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$7$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$9$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$11$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"می‌دانیم اتحاد زیر برقرار است:\n$(a+b)^3 = a^3+b^3 + 3ab(a+b)$\n$\\Rightarrow 3^3 = 18 + 3ab(3) \\Rightarrow 9ab = 9 \\Rightarrow ab = 1$\nاکنون $a^2+b^2$ را محاسبه می‌کنیم:\n$a^2+b^2 = (a+b)^2 - 2ab = 3^2 - 2 = 7$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":[],"media_evidence":[],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":270,"question_pdf":"5.pdf","question_page":6,"solution_page":27,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_0271","source_sha256":"da9dd191a0f64e434bf167b129d0872bb907d71b6daa824de042728fa03c946e","subject":"math","section_id":"math_algebraic_foundations","source_topic_key":"radicals_algebraic_expressions","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"اگر $x(x^2+3y^2)=76$ و $y(y^2+3x^2)=49$ باشد، مقدار $\\frac{x+y}{x-y}$ کدام است؟"}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$2$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{3}{2}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{4}{3}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{5}{3}$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"دو تساوی داده‌شده را در یک بار با هم جمع و یک بار از هم تفریق می‌کنیم:\n$\\begin{cases} x^3+3xy^2=76 \\\\ y^3+3x^2y=49 \\end{cases} \\xrightarrow{\\text{جمع}} x^3+3x^2y+3xy^2+y^3 = 125$\n$\\xrightarrow{\\text{تفریق}} x^3-3x^2y+3xy^2-y^3 = 27$\n$\\Rightarrow (x+y)^3 = 125 \\Rightarrow x+y = 5 \\}$\n$\\Rightarrow (x-y)^3 = 27 \\Rightarrow x-y = 3 \\} \\Rightarrow \\frac{x+y}{x-y} = \\frac{5}{3}$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":[],"media_evidence":[],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":271,"question_pdf":"5.pdf","question_page":6,"solution_page":27,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_0272","source_sha256":"d0dbbff6e751a25d9987fc7d2e6484bd66172cfcf2dce8bf8b27f6935a26ff1a","subject":"math","section_id":"math_algebraic_foundations","source_topic_key":"radicals_algebraic_expressions","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"اگر $a^3 - 3ab^2 = \\sqrt{13}$ و $b^3 - 3a^2b = \\sqrt{14}$ باشد، حاصل $a^2+b^2$ کدام است؟"}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$1$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$2$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$3$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$4$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"دو طرف تساوی‌های داده‌شده را به توان ۳ رسانده، سپس با هم جمع می‌کنیم:\n$a = \\sqrt[3]{13-3a^2b} \\Rightarrow a^3 = 13-3a^2b \\Rightarrow a^3+3a^2b = 13$\n$b = \\sqrt[3]{14-3ab^2} \\Rightarrow b^3 = 14-3ab^2 \\Rightarrow b^3+3ab^2 = 14$\n$\\xrightarrow{\\text{جمع}} (a+b)^3 = 27 \\Rightarrow a+b = 3$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":[],"media_evidence":[],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":272,"question_pdf":"5.pdf","question_page":6,"solution_page":27,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_0273","source_sha256":"0d792be9781568ee32cc2d0754cc88753f93fbbaf148bdee772fb13ba2807c5d","subject":"math","section_id":"math_algebraic_foundations","source_topic_key":"radicals_algebraic_expressions","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"اگر $2x^2+10x-3=0$ باشد، حاصل $P = (x+1)(x-1)(x+4)(x+6)$ کدام است؟"}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$-\\frac{24}{25}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$-\\frac{24}{5}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$-\\frac{24}{75}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$-25$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"از تساوی $۲x^۲ + ۱۰x - ۳ = ۰$ نتیجه می‌شود $x^۲ + ۵x = \\frac{۳}{۲}$\n$P = (x + ۱)(x + ۴)(x - ۱)(x + ۶) = (x^۲ + ۵x + ۴)(x^۲ + ۵x - ۶)$\n$= (\\frac{۳}{۲} + ۴)(\\frac{۳}{۲} - ۶) = \\frac{۱۱}{۲} \\times \\frac{-۹}{۲} = \\frac{-۹۹}{۴} = -۲۴/۷۵$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0273/solution_1.webp","alt":"حل سوال ۲۷۳","aspect_ratio":6.4237}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0273/solution_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0273/solution_1.webp","sha256":"3a4db5cd60628db59d0927215b03d352a8ac64e75c3c7d0fd51a76fb6228f211","bytes":6658}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":273,"question_pdf":"5.pdf","question_page":6,"solution_page":28,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_0274","source_sha256":"5568168326b3c4b0abfa8232d5fbe007caa35cf34f44863dc0e0ebb5932a3242","subject":"math","section_id":"math_algebraic_foundations","source_topic_key":"radicals_algebraic_expressions","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"با فرض $x^2-3x+5=0$، حاصل $P = (x-5)(x+2)$ کدام است؟"}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$15$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$-15$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$35$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$-35$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"با فرض $x^۲ + ۳x - ۵ = ۰$ نتیجه می‌شود $x^۲ + ۳x = ۵$\n$P = (x - ۵)(x + ۱)(x + ۳) = (x - ۵)(x^۲ + ۴x + ۳)$\n$= (x - ۵)(-۳x + ۵ + ۴x + ۳)$\n$= (x - ۵)(x + ۸) = x^۲ + ۳x - ۴۰$\n$= -۳x + ۵ + ۳x - ۴۰ = -۳۵$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0274/solution_1.webp","alt":"حل سوال ۲۷۴","aspect_ratio":6.4237}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0274/solution_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0274/solution_1.webp","sha256":"e296ea8646c250c768a377fe5e44bb93615345531ebaad1c3949bded35541720","bytes":6212}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":274,"question_pdf":"5.pdf","question_page":6,"solution_page":28,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_0275","source_sha256":"f82e27835130b53b17655bbab1018d2e7c7cebc81bca87d7880f6ee985eeea76","subject":"math","section_id":"math_algebraic_foundations","source_topic_key":"radicals_algebraic_expressions","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"اگر $5 = \\sqrt{x+6} + \\sqrt{x-4}$ باشد، حاصل $\\sqrt{x+6} - \\sqrt{x-4}$ کدام است؟"}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$1$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$2$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{1}{2}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{1}{5}$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"عبارت $k = \\sqrt{x + ۶} - \\sqrt{x - ۴}$ را $k$ می‌نامیم:\n$\\begin{cases} \\sqrt{x + ۶} - \\sqrt{x - ۴} = k \\\\ \\text{از طرفی : } \\sqrt{x + ۶} + \\sqrt{x - ۴} = ۵ \\end{cases}$\n$\\xrightarrow{\\text{ضرب}} ۵k = (x + ۶) - (x - ۴) = ۱۰ \\Rightarrow k = ۲$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0275/solution_1.webp","alt":"حل سوال ۲۷۵","aspect_ratio":5.9219}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0275/solution_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0275/solution_1.webp","sha256":"34abc88780389b64f3c3b6de67d76e10709d06a63a875184474430a3dcf98ded","bytes":7632}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":275,"question_pdf":"5.pdf","question_page":6,"solution_page":28,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_0276","source_sha256":"c59efa22da79a982836a074ee9ec7989c18e78be64eb28af7855569fbee5775b","subject":"math","section_id":"math_algebraic_foundations","source_topic_key":"radicals_algebraic_expressions","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"اگر $x - \\sqrt{x} = 2$ باشد، مقدار $10 + 8x - x^2$ کدام است؟"}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$-6$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$26$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$-4$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$16$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"دو طرف معادله را به توان ۲ می‌رسانیم:\n$\\sqrt{x - ۳ + \\sqrt{۵ - x}} = ۲ \\Rightarrow (\\sqrt{x - ۳ + \\sqrt{۵ - x}})^۲ = ۴$\n$\\Rightarrow x - ۳ + ۵ - x + ۲\\sqrt{-x^۲ + ۸x - ۱۵} = ۴$\n$\\Rightarrow \\sqrt{-x^۲ + ۸x - ۱۵} = ۱ \\Rightarrow -x^۲ + ۸x - ۱۵ = ۱$\n$\\Rightarrow x^۲ - ۸x = -۱۶ \\Rightarrow x^۲ - ۸x + ۱۰ = -۶$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0276/solution_1.webp","alt":"حل سوال ۲۷۶","aspect_ratio":5.4928}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0276/solution_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0276/solution_1.webp","sha256":"12566aee6b066fb34b405cd38449b866615d61ba273bc2b36fb8f24491af887c","bytes":9398}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":276,"question_pdf":"5.pdf","question_page":6,"solution_page":28,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_0277","source_sha256":"32d0fc65e9754340acd990753cd99b9ee024c4a70d5fd7223adaeef18971df28","subject":"math","section_id":"math_algebraic_foundations","source_topic_key":"radicals_algebraic_expressions","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"اگر $a - \\frac{1}{a} = 1$ باشد، $a^3$ برابر کدام است؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0277/stem_1.webp","alt":"سوال 277","aspect_ratio":0.1922}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$2a + 1$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$2a - 1$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$3a + 1$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$3a - 1$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"دو طرف معادلهٔ $a - \\frac{۱}{a} = ۱$ را در $a$ ضرب می‌کنیم:\n$a^۲ - ۱ = a \\Rightarrow a^۲ = a + ۱$\nدوباره دو طرف معادله را در $a$ ضرب می‌کنیم:\n$a^۳ = a^۲ + a = (a + ۱) + a = ۲a + ۱$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0277/solution_2.webp","alt":"حل سوال ۲۷۷","aspect_ratio":7.7347}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0277/solution_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0277/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0277/solution_2.webp","sha256":"4c9b0f53c4b7ac415279fd6b2c0e6371567c076bf1b31f580882e91b49c7e17f","bytes":8888},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0277/stem_1.webp","sha256":"1e5fea4fba9f257946fc2416f6435af67674c7dc0c4d13d337bad8749f0c9c38","bytes":4462}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":277,"question_pdf":"5.pdf","question_page":7,"solution_page":28,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_0278","source_sha256":"2b7f637034938cc77e14db341b7b5c9e453cb555abf95c5486b5196a4af44d4f","subject":"math","section_id":"math_algebraic_foundations","source_topic_key":"radicals_algebraic_expressions","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"اگر $x + \\frac{1}{x} = 1$ باشد، حاصل $x^5$ کدام است؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0278/stem_1.webp","alt":"سوال 278","aspect_ratio":0.1769}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$5x - 3$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$3x - 2$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$2 - 3x$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$3 - 5x$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"دو طرف معادله را در $x$ ضرب می‌کنیم:\n$\\frac{۱}{x} = ۱ + x \\Rightarrow ۱ = x + x^۲ \\Rightarrow x^۲ = ۱ - x \\quad (۱)$\nدو طرف معادلهٔ (۱) را در $x$ ضرب می‌کنیم:\n$x^۳ = x - x^۲ \\quad (۲)$\nدو طرف معادلات (۱) و (۲) را در هم ضرب می‌کنیم:\n$x^۵ = (x - x^۲)(۱ - x) = x - x^۲ - x^۲ + x^۳ = x - ۲x^۲ + x^۳$\n$= x - ۲x^۲ + (x - x^۲)$\n$= ۲x - ۳x^۲ = ۲x - ۳(۱ - x) = ۵x - ۳$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0278/solution_2.webp","alt":"حل سوال ۲۷۸","aspect_ratio":3.6442}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0278/solution_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0278/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0278/solution_2.webp","sha256":"1c4d448bbd148ed957a90ae8c67a77872fd4ef2e9f61c54f0b958ef9b447c37d","bytes":11532},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0278/stem_1.webp","sha256":"f107f5778d0d87dc1e4ff482d0b83e65b81aca11e140b0c9904578593670b037","bytes":3050}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":278,"question_pdf":"5.pdf","question_page":7,"solution_page":28,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_0279","source_sha256":"0d8cb06d0557521b2beccab9092ae4e897712777f6e1d356c7258dfc30e6a074","subject":"math","section_id":"math_algebraic_foundations","source_topic_key":"radicals_algebraic_expressions","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"اگر تساوی $2x^2 + bx + c = a(x + 2)^2 - 4(2x + 1)$ برای هر عدد حقیقی $x$ برقرار باشد، $a + b + c$ کدام است؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0279/stem_1.webp","alt":"سوال 279","aspect_ratio":0.078}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$4$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$5$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$6$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$8$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"اگر یک تساوی به ازای هر عدد حقیقی $x$ برقرار باشد، یعنی یک اتحاد است. در اتحادها ضرایب جملات مشابه با هم برابرند. سمت چپ تساوی را ساده می‌کنیم:\n$a(x + ۲)^۲ - ۴(۲x + ۱) = ax^۲ + ۴ax + ۴a - ۸x - ۴$\n$= ax^۲ + (۴a - ۸)x + ۴a - ۴$\n$\\Rightarrow ax^۲ + (۴a - ۸)x + ۴a - ۴ = ۲x^۲ + bx + c$\n$\\Rightarrow \\begin{cases} a = ۲ \\\\ ۴a - ۸ = b \\Rightarrow b = ۰ \\\\ ۴a - ۴ = c \\Rightarrow c = ۴ \\end{cases} \\Rightarrow a + b + c = ۲ + ۰ + ۴ = ۶$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0279/solution_2.webp","alt":"حل سوال ۲۷۹","aspect_ratio":3.6442}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0279/solution_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0279/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0279/solution_2.webp","sha256":"786c9d1613767bacc21d484768c35c4e4ca38c979b5ade96d4a43b619fd40aa2","bytes":10054},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0279/stem_1.webp","sha256":"f04f67621af979ba37be23453f85b9eecb6f415e3bebbe4331c6d4ad89cbd13e","bytes":8170}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":279,"question_pdf":"5.pdf","question_page":7,"solution_page":28,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_0280","source_sha256":"da75d2e9422ec0da319c8f12510d3f1ec1b43b4c0b32d771058bcde2cb3bda32","subject":"math","section_id":"math_algebraic_foundations","source_topic_key":"radicals_algebraic_expressions","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"با توجه به اتحاد $8x^3 + 28x^2 + 49x + 31 = a(x + 2)^3 + b(2x + 1)^2 + c(x + 2)$، مقدار $c$ کدام است؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0280/stem_1.webp","alt":"سوال 280","aspect_ratio":0.0814}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$2$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$-2$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$3$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$-3$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"سمت چپ تساوی را ساده کرده، برابر با سمت راست تساوی قرار می‌دهیم:\n$a(۲x + ۳)^۳ + b(۲x + ۱)^۲ + c(x + ۲)$\n$= a(۸x^۳ + ۳۶x^۲ + ۵۴x + ۲۷) + b(۴x^۲ + ۴x + ۱) + cx + ۲c$\n$= ۸ax^۳ + (۳۶a + ۴b)x^۲ + (۵۴a + ۴b + c)x + ۲۷a + b + ۲c$\n$= ۸x^۳ + ۲۸x^۲ + ۴۹x + ۳۱$\n$\\Rightarrow \\begin{cases} ۸a = ۸ \\Rightarrow a = ۱ \\\\ ۳۶a + ۴b = ۲۸ \\Rightarrow ۴b = -۸ \\Rightarrow b = -۲ \\\\ ۵۴a + ۴b + c = ۴۹ \\Rightarrow ۵۴ - ۸ + c = ۴۹ \\Rightarrow c = ۳ \\end{cases}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0280/solution_2.webp","alt":"حل سوال ۲۸۰","aspect_ratio":3.1415}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0280/solution_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0280/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0280/solution_2.webp","sha256":"6714102c765e4d88f13280bb71eb54e6c324dd4b0b68e05595d7f57271a0cc8c","bytes":51070},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0280/stem_1.webp","sha256":"7c0f90e4ea7c32a8736694b6bc1832756123a27d0511af2455837f253e8ae668","bytes":19918}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":280,"question_pdf":"5.pdf","question_page":7,"solution_page":28,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_0281","source_sha256":"d5d39d26bb7ab49ac23c93b92233aa6f70e1b06fdc834f8a4f874f9abfd4c2c7","subject":"math","section_id":"math_algebraic_foundations","source_topic_key":"radicals_algebraic_expressions","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"اگر $a^2 + b^2 + 4c^2 + 4a - 2b + 4c = -6$ باشد، $\\frac{ab}{c}$ کدام است؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0281/stem_1.webp","alt":"سوال 281","aspect_ratio":0.1267}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$1$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$-1$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$4$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$-4$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"تساوی داده‌شده را مرتب می‌کنیم:\n$a^۲ + b^۲ + ۴c^۲ + ۴a - ۲b + ۴c = -۶$\n$\\Rightarrow a^۲ + ۴a + b^۲ - ۲b + ۴c^۲ + ۴c + ۶ = ۰$\n$\\Rightarrow (a^۲ + ۴a + ۴ - ۴) + (b^۲ - ۲b + ۱ - ۱) + (۴c^۲ + ۴c + ۱ - ۱) + ۶ = ۰$\n$\\Rightarrow (a + ۲)^۲ - ۴ + (b - ۱)^۲ - ۱ + (۲c + ۱)^۲ - ۱ + ۶ = ۰$\n$\\Rightarrow (a + ۲)^۲ + (b - ۱)^۲ + (۲c + ۱)^۲ = ۰$\nجمع سه عبارت نامنفی برابر صفر شده است در نتیجه هر سه عبارت برابر صفر است.\n$\\Rightarrow a = -۲, b = ۱, c = -\\frac{۱}{۲} \\Rightarrow \\frac{ab}{c} = ۴$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0281/solution_2.webp","alt":"حل سوال ۲۸۱","aspect_ratio":2.7879}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0281/solution_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0281/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0281/solution_2.webp","sha256":"69d7a5613b1f731343f12a1bb4038568d09fcee73a7bd6d671a94ba7c47a7578","bytes":52464},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0281/stem_1.webp","sha256":"780ede6a062401ee21192ee733cc42a8c2ffb1730f6f2bcd380ff883c2360248","bytes":9406}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":281,"question_pdf":"5.pdf","question_page":7,"solution_page":28,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_0282","source_sha256":"d1931db489d2b802bbd807c94a6679edf3dac277b5b5f06a7eeb0e2ffd879359","subject":"math","section_id":"math_algebraic_foundations","source_topic_key":"radicals_algebraic_expressions","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"با فرض $x - \\frac{3}{x} = 3$، مقدار $x + \\frac{3}{x}$ کدام است؟ ($x > 0$)"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0282/stem_1.webp","alt":"سوال 282","aspect_ratio":0.1592}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$\\sqrt{21}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\sqrt{23}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\sqrt{19}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\sqrt{17}$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"دو طرف معادلهٔ $x - \\frac{۳}{x} = ۳$ را به توان ۲ می‌رسانیم:\n$(x - \\frac{۳}{x})^۲ = ۹ \\Rightarrow x^۲ + \\frac{۹}{x^۲} - ۶ = ۹ \\Rightarrow x^۲ + \\frac{۹}{x^۲} = ۱۵$\nعبارت $x + \\frac{۳}{x}$ را $A$ می‌نامیم، چون $x > ۰$ است، بنابراین $A > ۰$ می‌باشد:\n$A = x + \\frac{۳}{x} \\Rightarrow A^۲ = x^۲ + \\frac{۹}{x^۲} + ۶ = ۱۵ + ۶ = ۲۱$\n$\\Rightarrow A = \\pm\\sqrt{۲۱} \\xrightarrow{A > ۰} A = \\sqrt{۲۱}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0282/solution_2.webp","alt":"حل سوال ۲۸۲","aspect_ratio":3.5778}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0282/solution_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0282/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0282/solution_2.webp","sha256":"083c77f703829a1fa26c6c6181bb53663d3ac5f720eb9b1550845ae4299c887c","bytes":38210},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0282/stem_1.webp","sha256":"d471dda7671eae9e472d5b8c674d4ef7085e617339409390b732161b7373e972","bytes":11828}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":282,"question_pdf":"5.pdf","question_page":7,"solution_page":28,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_0283","source_sha256":"a82c8744736d758a2089716b3b749edbd82eddea247e7253d64054939ea5388c","subject":"math","section_id":"math_algebraic_foundations","source_topic_key":"radicals_algebraic_expressions","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"در تجزیه عبارت $(x - 3)(x + 2)(x + 4) - 12x$، کدام عامل ضرب وجود ندارد؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0283/stem_1.webp","alt":"سوال 283","aspect_ratio":0.1008}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$x + 1$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$x + 2$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$x + 6$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$x - 4$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"روش اول: عبارت $x(x + ۱)(x + ۴) - ۱۲x - ۱۲$ را به صورت $x(x + ۱)(x + ۴) - ۱۲(x + ۱)$ نوشته و از عامل $x + ۱$ در دو جملهٔ موجود فاکتور می‌گیریم:\n$x(x + ۱)(x + ۴) - ۱۲(x + ۱) = (x + ۱)(x(x + ۴) - ۱۲)$\n$= (x + ۱)(x^۲ + ۴x - ۱۲) = (x + ۱)(x + ۶)(x - ۲)$\nروش دوم: اگر عبارت $A$ شامل عامل $x - a$ باشد، به ازای $x = a$ برابر صفر می‌شود. عبارت داده‌شده به ازای $x = -۱$، $x = -۶$ و $x = ۲$ برابر صفر می‌شود، اما به ازای $x = -۲$ صفر نمی‌شود. بنابراین عامل $x + ۲$ را ندارد."},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0283/solution_2.webp","alt":"حل سوال ۲۸۳","aspect_ratio":3.3455}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0283/solution_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0283/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0283/solution_2.webp","sha256":"5d63b3170b060e4fad247c5d5e3e8e6bbaac5946cbddbd29e64647b3ffed5d85","bytes":52646},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0283/stem_1.webp","sha256":"96df07098c0a89c6ae9b54bff5e68615f2bf8150b1163240813eaac99484628c","bytes":12354}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":283,"question_pdf":"5.pdf","question_page":7,"solution_page":28,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_0284","source_sha256":"f5ceef3db14c9d9af55b5cb23ad8d818000582e2a82b866508700bacf94c24dc","subject":"math","section_id":"math_algebraic_foundations","source_topic_key":"radicals_algebraic_expressions","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"در تجزیه عبارت $(x^2 - 4)^2 - x^2$، کدام عامل وجود ندارد؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0284/stem_1.webp","alt":"سوال 284","aspect_ratio":0.1342}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$x - 2$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$x + 3$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$x + 2$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$x + 1$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"ابتدا از اتحاد مزدوج استفاده می‌کنیم:\n$(x^۲ + x - ۴)^۲ - ۲^۲ = (x^۲ + x - ۴ - ۲)(x^۲ + x - ۴ + ۲)$\n$= (x^۲ + x - ۶)(x^۲ + x - ۲) = (x + ۳)(x - ۲)(x - ۱)(x + ۲)$\nواضح است که عامل $x + ۱$ در تجزیهٔ عبارت وجود ندارد."},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0284/solution_2.webp","alt":"حل سوال ۲۸۴","aspect_ratio":5.5279}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0284/solution_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0284/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0284/solution_2.webp","sha256":"d6b3c0a361bf348d7010481e6b0848858c421338bd453d1e6aed960d5d832c53","bytes":34454},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0284/stem_1.webp","sha256":"2e4c9942b79950a60c3fc5f5150a60f30c8e2244884fde78f2a9c8b3193ea383","bytes":14568}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":284,"question_pdf":"5.pdf","question_page":7,"solution_page":28,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_0285","source_sha256":"1354bf8d64ba1835a43b73b8216227f6c546826c9ad626a250528e24746b880f","subject":"math","section_id":"math_algebraic_foundations","source_topic_key":"radicals_algebraic_expressions","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"عبارت $(x + 7)(x + 5)(x + 3)(x + 1) + k$ مربع چند جمله‌ای $f(x)$ است. مقدار $k$ کدام است؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0285/stem_1.webp","alt":"سوال 285","aspect_ratio":0.0903}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$16$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$64$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$1$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$49$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"دو جملهٔ $(x + ۱)$ و $(x + ۷)$ با هم و دو جملهٔ $(x + ۳)$ و $(x + ۵)$ را نیز با هم در نظر گرفته و ضرب می‌کنیم:\n$(x + ۱)(x + ۷)(x + ۳)(x + ۵) + k$\n$= (x^۲ + ۸x + ۷)(x^۲ + ۸x + ۱۵) + k$\n$\\xrightarrow{x^۲ + ۸x = a} (a + ۷)(a + ۱۵) + k = a^۲ + ۲۲a + ۱۰۵ + k$\nبا توجه به جملهٔ اول عبارت به دست آمده مربع کامل آن به صورت $(a + ۱۱)^۲$ می‌باشد که برابر با $a^۲ + ۲۲a + ۱۲۱$ است. بنابراین:\n$k = ۱۲۱ - ۱۰۵ = ۱۶$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0285/solution_2.webp","alt":"حل سوال ۲۸۵","aspect_ratio":3.1338}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0285/solution_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0285/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0285/solution_2.webp","sha256":"fbd2f162af3ac4768f16659fc675fb3c93c70d3b962e3bfdd0f54bd596990152","bytes":49736},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0285/stem_1.webp","sha256":"00d0bcf1b6d39724e55d8fe4006b26ab596719f7dc11240320ea46d7b88d01b8","bytes":17942}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":285,"question_pdf":"5.pdf","question_page":7,"solution_page":28,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_0286","source_sha256":"0aa1d0936c4ad2d2675667472cd7fe3c1df1700fc9731e03eec7c5d3cda63028","subject":"math","section_id":"math_algebraic_foundations","source_topic_key":"radicals_algebraic_expressions","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"در تجزیه $2a - x - 3ax^2 + 4x^3$، عامل $x + 2$ وجود دارد. $a$ کدام است؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0286/stem_1.webp","alt":"سوال 286","aspect_ratio":0.1153}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$1$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$-2$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$2$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$3$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"چون در عبارت $P = 4x^3 + 3ax^2 - x - 2a$ عامل $x+2$ وجود دارد، به ازای $x=-2$ برابر صفر می‌شود:\n\n$x = -2 \\Rightarrow P = 0 \\Rightarrow -32 + 12a + 2 - 2a = 0$\n\n$\\Rightarrow 10a = 30 \\Rightarrow a = 3$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0286/solution_2.webp","alt":"حل سوال ۲۸۶","aspect_ratio":0.1538}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0286/solution_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0286/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0286/solution_2.webp","sha256":"f2b95ded9e7dfd1c63e653f62910305082e3e55aac